          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beli hakubandama, Nebo hakunoŋama. Nkishi jawu jakusenda kudi anyama nawayimuna, hiyuma yakusenda senda, hiyiteli yakuzeyesha nachu anyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakunoŋama, hiyakubandamina hamu. Wenahiyatwesheli kwamuna chiteluku, chikaŋa awenawu wowu aya dehi muwukoli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntiyililenu enu akwamutaŋa waYakoba, ninenu mwashala kumutaŋa waIsarela, kufumisha himwafumini mwivumu kuyeleka hohu, kufumisha himwavwalikili kuyipakata hohu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kushika nikuwushinakaji wenu, yami, kushika nihakumena invu, yami nukuyelekaŋa; chuma chinatuŋili dichi chinukwelekaŋa; mwalala nukwilaŋa nikweleka, nikupulwisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukunfwikija neyinyi? Mukuŋesekesha nanyi? Mukunfwanisha neyinyi mwakatwa kadifwani nindi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Echumunaŋa wuru munjeki, apezeleshaŋa siliva hapezu, hiyakukwata muchi wawuru, yena hakuyichila mukishi, hiyakudimbuka, eŋa, hiyakudifukula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiya kumwelekaŋa hachifwiji, hiyakumutwala, hiyakumwimika mwiluŋa dindi, hakwimana. Hakafuma mwiluŋa dinduku. Eŋa, muntu wakadilila kudi yena, ilaŋa yena hakutwesha kumwakula hela kumwa mwina mwihuŋu dinduku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anukenu chumichi, dinkenuku jawuyala, tiyenu kumuchima ke-su, enu mwamotokaŋa nshimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anukenu yuma yásambilili kushankulu, muloŋa ami yami Nzambi, hikudi wacheŋuku; yami Nzambi, hikudi wadifwanananamuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumisha kutachi nashimunaŋa jakunsa, kufumisha kushankulunashi munaŋa yichidi kanda ayikoŋi; nami, Mpuŋa yami yakakola, nakela munafuukula mwejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natambiki kumusela kajila watuhuka, natambiki muntu nafuukula kwituŋa dadilehi. Eŋa, nahoshi dehi, nukuchiilahohu. Nafuukuli dehi, nukuchikoŋa nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwasweja Ŋovu munyi chima, mwekalaŋa kwakulehi nakuloŋa, tiyililenu kudami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakaletakuloŋa kwami kwakwihi, hikwakekala kwakulehuku, wamwinu wami hiwakalabaku. Lubanji lwami Isarela nakamushila wamwinu muZiyona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.46.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
